      "object_role": "synthesis",
      "proposed_content": "Smooth localization repeatedly makes the transform analysis tractable—support control permits contour shifts, integration by parts truncates frequencies, and oscillatory saddle estimates extend a pointwise range—but a Gaussian-smoothed spectral transformation is not by itself control of the unsmoothed unit-window exponential sum required by the main cancellation conjecture.",
