    {
      "object_id": "mathia_synthesis_f399b8c54e6cb8bf3a45f3163926ec9e1d658d76d396854fe44224e401a310ed",
      "object_role": "synthesis",
      "proposed_content": "The paper organizes several conjectures by implication rather than treating them as interchangeable: pointwise Conjecture 2 implies mean-square Conjecture 1; Conjecture 1 implies the target E2 and eighth-moment bounds; Conjecture 3 conditionally implies those two targets but is linked to Conjecture 2 only heuristically; narrower equivalences connect the eighth moment to a weaker piecewise Z2 bound, Conjecture 2 to a vertical-decay formulation, and the full family of Zk continuations to the Lindelof moment hierarchy.",
